% The worked example from velato.net's Hello World tutorial, note for note.
% This one is written by hand rather than by scripts/gen-velato-examples.lean,
% because it is the program the tutorial walks through and the point is that
% it is exactly those eight notes.
%
%   C4  root: the first note of the song is the command root
%   A4  major 6th from the root: a special command
%   G4  perfect 5th: ... which makes it Print
%   E4  major 3rd: a value
%   F4  perfect 4th: ... of type char
%   A4  major 6th: the digit 7
%   D#4 minor 3rd: the digit 2      -- 72 is 'H'
%   G4  perfect 5th: end of number
%
% Run: lake exe velato Langlib/Examples/Velato/print-h.vel
C4 A4 G4 E4 F4 A4 D#4 G4
